//! not a simulated provider). Every row is validated at sync time
//! against GymAct's real SHACL constraint (`ontology/profile.shacl.ttl`,
//! a real symlink to `src/gymact/ontology/profile.shacl.ttl` in this
//! same repo -- `urn:gymact:shape:capability`), never hand-copied or
//! re-derived.
//!
//! `consequence_class` is either "Read" or "Do", resolved from GymAct's
//! real consequence-class IRIs (`urn:gymact:consequence:read`/
//! `urn:gymact:consequence:do`). The four "Do" rows below
//! (`apply_patch`, `git_commit`, `run_test`, `run_build`) each mutate the
